OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers wider region
OL,4,Astrategic authority
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have agreed to consider a
OL,7,Fproposal to be part of a mayoral
OL,8,Fstrategic authority formed from
OL,9,Fcouncils across counties connecting
OL,10,FOxford and Cambridge.
OL,12,FAdam Zerny, the leader of Central
OL,13,FBedfordshire Council, said at a meeting
OL,14,Fon Wednesday an authority that included
OL,15,Fcouncils across Northamptonshire,
OL,16,FOxfordshire, Cambridgeshire and
OL,17,FPeterborough would be powerful and get
OL,18,Fmore funding.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
