OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers wider region
OL,4,Astrategic authority
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If we are going to get the best
OL,7,Fpossible deal we have got to make sure
OL,8,Fwe get as many local authorities around
OL,9,Fthe table as possible," he said.
OL,11,FCouncils in Luton and Milton Keynes
OL,12,Fsaid they still favoured a model that
OL,13,Fonly included unitary authorities in
OL,14,FBedfordshire and Milton Keynes.
